Package: GMAL
Type: Package
Title: Generalized Median Adaptive Lasso for Causal Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yahang", "Liu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yhliu22@m.fudan.edu.cn")
Description: Selects covariates using median-regression adaptive penalty
    weights, tunes selection using covariate balance, and estimates an
    inverse-probability-weighted marginal treatment effect. Supports binary
    and continuous treatments using the algorithm described by Liu et al.
    (2024) <doi:10.1093/bib/bbae059>. This is a newly packaged research
    implementation, not a bit-for-bit reproduction of all published analyses.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: lqa, quantreg, survey, stats
Suggests: CBPS
